WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.302
This query uses common table expressions and a window function.

00:00:04.302 --> 00:00:08.877
The monthly sales stage has one row per month and product.

00:00:08.877 --> 00:00:13.732
The ranked stage keeps that grain and adds a rank within each month.

00:00:13.732 --> 00:00:17.902
The final select keeps the top two rank groups.

00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:24.040
This is a good example of readable staged S Q L that can transfer to Spark S Q L.
